    "message": "ci: drop the broken TestPyPI publish job (#36)\n\nThe django-pglocks name on TestPyPI is held by an unrelated account, so the\ntrusted-publishing token exchange always fails (invalid-publisher) and the\njob red-Xed on every tag push. Remove it; build + publish-pypi (on release)\nremain. Pre-release validation is done locally (uv build + twine check).",
    "tree": {
     "sha": "f79c4c71a5c2bffaf2f1626e6d385f949bafbb56",
     "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Xof/django-pglocks/git/trees/f79c4c71a5c2bffaf2f1626e6d385f949bafbb56"
    },
    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Xof/django-pglocks/git/commits/9d3014bda1ab414d74a4d5e4ccaf70d8808f81a0",
