    "message": "Update docs: convert README to Markdown, revise CHANGELOG, clean up dependencies\n\n- Convert README.rst to README.md\n- Rename LICENSE.txt to LICENSE.md\n- Remove psycopg2-binary from runtime dependencies (user-supplied)\n- Add psycopg2-binary to dev dependencies for testing\n- Expand README with keyword-only docs, parameter details, upgrade guide\n- More accurate CHANGELOG (sync_to_async, test counts, CI details)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
